Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.01,Hdr,,0,0,0,,November 25, 1984 - Japan Cup
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Katsuragi Ace went for broke up front - still holding the lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:06.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,And on the inside, the red cap - Britain's Bedtime is chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:09.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Out wide, here comes Symboli Rudolf
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:11.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Katsuragi Ace leads - he's holding on, holding on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:13.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then Bedtime and Symboli Rudolf
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:15.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mr. C.B. is in the middle of the pack
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Katsuragi Ace just in front - still hanging on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:21.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Bedtime inside, Symboli Rudolf outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,And now Majesty's Prince is charging home too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:28.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Beating two Japanese Triple Crown winners and the world's best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:31.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Katsuragi Ace leads all the way to the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:35.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,The first Japanese horse to win the Japan Cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:40.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Katsuragi Ace - a brave front-running ride that opens a door in history